@startuml
actor Customer
participant "React Native App" as App
participant "Express API" as API
database MongoDB as DB
Customer -> App: Tap Place Order
App -> API: POST /api/orders + Bearer token
API -> API: Verify JWT and validate cart
API -> DB: Read current menu prices and availability
DB --> API: Menu item documents
API -> API: Calculate trusted totals
API -> DB: Insert Order document
DB --> API: Saved order
API --> App: 201 Created + order JSON
App --> Customer: Show order tracking
@enduml
